                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "You’ll be introduced to some of the best-known concepts and puzzles (ciphers) in cryptography, which I think are fairly accessible for beginners.\nHowever, since the difficulty is far from linear, you’ll quickly find yourself stuck.\nFor experts, this game is a good refresher but may lacks content.\nA level editor and workshop would have been a nice adding, but for a game that costs 5€ there’s not much more to expect.",
